# Modular Display System, Generation 4, Driver

This repository contains the hardware designs for the driver board. For more information, visit the [Modular LED Display website](https://reiserlab.github.io/Modular-LED-Display/) under the [Generation 4](https://reiserlab.github.io/Modular-LED-Display/G4) menu.

A preprint of the Generation 4 methods paper is available:

Isaacson, Matthew; Ferguson, Lisa; Loesche, Frank; Ganguly, Ishani; Chen, Jim; Chiu, Andy; Liu, Jinyang; Dickson, William; Reiser, Michael B. (2022): "A High-Speed, Modular Display System for Diverse Neuroscience Applications." In: *bioRxiv*. DOI: [10.1101/2022.08.02.502550](https://doi.org/10.1101/2022.08.02.502550).


The complete system for the previous Generation 3 modular displays was described in the following publication:

Reiser, Michael B.; Dickinson, Michael H. (2008): "A modular display system for insect behavioral neuroscience." In: *Journal of Neuroscience Methods*. 167 (2), pp.&nbsp;127–139, DOI: [10.1016/j.jneumeth.2007.07.019](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jneumeth.2007.07.019).

Before June 2020, this repository was hosted on `https://bitbucket.org/mreiser`.

